v 3
d exporttables: export a table for every variable of a survey dataset to Excel
d
d Single choice -> N and %; multiple choice (select_multiple) -> N and % of
d cases with valid cases (N); continuous -> N, mean, median, mode, SD, min,
d max; text with at most 50 different answers -> N and %.  With by(), every
d table is crossed by a category such as district, plus Total.  Writes a
d formatted workbook with an Index sheet.  Pure Stata, no Python.
d
d Requires: Stata 16 or newer
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261010
d
d Author: Md. Redoan Hossain Bhuiyan
d Support: https://github.com/RanaRedoan/exporttables/issues
d
f src/exporttables.ado
f src/exporttables.sthlp
f examples/example.do
